---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-paper2 text-ink">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-8 pb-[calc(22px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))] md:px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-b border-[rgba(62,45,32,.14)] pb-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full border border-current text-lg text-rust">ಕ</span>
        <span>
          <strong class="block font-serif text-2xl leading-none tracking-tight">ಕದಳಿ</strong>
          <small class="block font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[.1em] opacity-80">ಮಹಿಳಾ ಸಮಾಜ</small>
        </span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 font-sans text-[13px] text-muted md:flex-row md:gap-6">
        <span>✉ hello@kadali.example.org</span>
        <span>⌖ ನಿಮ್ಮ ಊರು, ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ</span>
        <span>☎ +91 XXXXX XXXXX</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pt-5 font-sans text-[11px] text-muted md:flex-row md:justify-between">
      <span>© {year} ಕದಳಿ ಮಹಿಳಾ ಸಮಾಜ. ಎಲ್ಲ ಹಕ್ಕುಗಳನ್ನು ಕಾಯ್ದಿರಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ.</span>
      <span>ಭಕ್ತಿ · ಸಂಸ್ಕೃತಿ · ಸೇವೆ · ಸಾಹಿತ್ಯ</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
